    ; entity with an EMPTY external id (no system id), remember it in the
    ; undefined-entity table keyed by name (so subsequent references reuse it), and
    ; run generateSystemId — with no entity catalog to map the name to a storage id
    ; it always fails, reporting cannotGenerateSystemIdGeneral (Warning) at the
